<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese militia boats are intensifying battlefield preparation in the western Pacific while the Chinese coast guard continues to monitor Philippine resupply missions to the grounded warship at the contested shoal. The Philippine Coast Guard rescued 20 people off Basilan and opened an upgraded station on Pag-asa Island, but its personnel were killed and another wounded in a shooting in Cotabato City. Taiwan has offered cooperation with the Philippines to protect undersea cables and an ex-NSA urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOTXI3SFRVTXFrMURWSExwd01uY0lFUVZ4M3J2amc4XzE3QVBidmZZOU9qVUFkQ3c3U1RSMG8wOTZ1M1M5Q1RXM0RwUzN5MkpILTEwQ3hjdjlQRU1jWVUyb1JXT3BFdzRWdFdyZzcxLXNoUk5hWDlTY2I3LWRpYkpZUkg1bmJtamZRYnMtdTJvOG5VX21RQ05fRkJCY082Ql90ME1zYllHZ1MyS211WWdDd2l3WFJ0dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1aaDFZc0NKU3IxaExETnFoVVJ4NFF5NW9YUG96bTYzeGowOUEyNk5EWjg1Z0dpcjdQc3o5bGdiaUxMRmRVLTB1a1Bmek94amlQcFZyZC1pbHE1VEJ0ODFHM0VCbzR2bnlKUklIY20wTUtxcDduTGdEamdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taipei Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOYTBSalU3ZGU0TU9nQnktTlAzdUstd2tBLWlCLTZ1dWJKUFBTYWZsZTB3TGxsVVlCRUMxTXIxckhDMk90TnVEb0xEZGN5ZThULW1heWFDT0hYdDRWSzNfZzFxU3NhSDd2UFZhRXZ0WWFXS3pXTkhscnpLb05CNDl0aDc1Mkl3SHZFeGFXNFB2em5QUUY5OE1Obm4tNE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWTRrNURLZzBTUkRlamIxSWtLazNtRGRveVFtT0NHSktrQjExSTA4MHBGLWYwQ09KcW1VMUhGRHFKclhfa2lCOS1HdVJJYTRHbWpDTGlKWlBTS0NyRGtzNEc5cHBMMVR6M19NZ01jRFVsZm4yaDRsSGNCVGxH